                                "example_id": "d32cdeba-e63e-4b58-adce-9e488c059d63",
                                "sense_id": "4b9cd169-1223-3e52-8764-8bce6287715c",
                                "text": "Now things are less confrontational but just as niggly. The Spanish examine drivers' papers with elaborate care, causing huge traffic jams"
